Linux: stop the certificate question on every launch
The AppImage's bundled OpenSSL looks for CA certificates under the build
machine's prefix. Finding none, OrcaSlicer's startup picks the distro's
bundle itself but first asks "use system SSL certificate ... Do you want to
continue?" on every launch. The launcher now sets SSL_CERT_FILE to the first
bundle that exists, from the same list in the same order, and keeps a value
the user already set.

