Welcome screen: the clip plays on Linux without extra codecs
Linux's web view (WebKitGTK) decodes H.264 only when the user has installed
gstreamer1.0-libav, so a stock Ubuntu showed an empty box where the welcome
clip goes. The screen now offers a VP9 WebM copy first and the mp4 second.
Checked playing on Ubuntu 24.04 without libav, in the Mac's WKWebView and in
Chromium.

